PASTE-YOUR-DEEPSEEK-API-KEY-ON-A-SINGLE-LINE-HERE
# Only needed for the DeepSeek fallback (HARNESS_AGENTS_AUTH=deepseek).
#
# Copy this file to `secrets/deepseek-api-key` (no .example suffix) and replace
# the line above with your real key. The real file is gitignored. DeepSeek bills
# PER TOKEN, so prefer the default ChatGPT OAuth auth (no per-call cost) unless
# you lack a ChatGPT subscription.
#
# The launch script reads the key from this file and passes it to each
# real-agent worker via the environment (HARNESS_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY), never argv.
